<given-names>YM</given-names></name><name><surname>Bouchard</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names><suffix>Jr.</suffix></name><name><surname>Lykken</surname><given-names>DT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Genetic and environmental influence on morningness-eveningness</article-title><source>Personality and Individual Differences</source><year>1998</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>917</fpage><lpage>925</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0191-8869(98)00089-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Heath</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name><name><surname>Kendler</surname><given-names>KS</given-names></name><name><surname>Eaves</surname><given-names>LJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Martin</surname><given-names>NG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Evidence for genetic influences on sleep disturbance and sleep pattern in twins</article-title><source>Sleep</source><year>1990</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>318</fpage><lpage>335</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2267475</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Klei</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Reitz</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Miller</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Wood</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Maendel</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Gross</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Waldner</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Eaton</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Monk</surname><given-names>TH</given-names></name><name><surname>Nimgaonkar</surname><given-names>VL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Heritability of morningness-eveningness and self-report sleep measures in a fam